From: damnbitimcrit <333091414+damnbitimcrit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Halo 3] Mouse aim

Adds raw mouse motion to the yaw and pitch deltas of local player 0's
action where the game builds it from the controller (sub_82211EA8), after
the stick acceleration and aim assist. The game then treats it like stick
input: it is dropped while player input is disabled (pause menu, scripted
scenes), follows the "scale all input" script factor and the pitch, seat
and vehicle limits. It is divided by the zoom magnification like the
stick.

Configured with halo3_mouse_aim, halo3_mouse_sensitivity,
halo3_mouse_zoom_sensitivity and halo3_mouse_invert_y.
---
 src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.cc       |   1 +
 src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.h        |   2 +
 src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3_input.cc | 134 ++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 137 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3_input.cc

diff --git a/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.cc b/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.cc
index 0dc208e..7e049ed 100644
--- a/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.cc
+++ b/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.cc
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@ void Install(KernelState* kernel_state, UserModule* module) {
   XELOGI("Halo 3 (TU0) detected; installing hooks");
   InstallFramePacing(kernel_state);
   InstallInterpolation(kernel_state);
+  InstallInput(kernel_state);
 }
 
 }  // namespace halo3
diff --git a/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.h b/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.h
index ace2a70..541acb8 100644
--- a/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.h
+++ b/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3.h
@@ -36,6 +36,8 @@ void Install(KernelState* kernel_state, UserModule* module);
 void InstallFramePacing(KernelState* kernel_state);
 // halo3_interp.cc
 void InstallInterpolation(KernelState* kernel_state);
+// halo3_input.cc
+void InstallInput(KernelState* kernel_state);
 
 }  // namespace halo3
 }  // namespace title
diff --git a/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3_input.cc b/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3_input.cc
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9e4a9ac
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/xenia/kernel/title/halo3/halo3_input.cc
@@ -0,0 +1,134 @@
+/**
+ ******************************************************************************
+ * Xenia : Xbox 360 Emulator Research Project                                 *
+ ******************************************************************************
